        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kolandoi eng’ Jordan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kong’eet anyun Josua karon mising’, ak kiba eng’ Sitim, agoi koit Jordan, inendet ak lagokab Israel tugul; ak kiruiyo yoto kotom kolanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingobata betusiek somogu, koba kiptainik kobun kwenuteb nganaset; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kong’at bik, kolenji, Ye ogeer moingetab arorutietab Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’, ak tisiik Lawik koibei, ong’eetye anyun eng’ ole omi, ak osub. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago oloochine ak moinget eng’ kakwautik elfusiek aeng’ che bo eut: amorikyi moinget, si kobiit onai oret ne nyoljinok obun; amu tom obune orani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenji Josua bik, Oanyinyge: amu yaei Jehovah kwong’utik mutai eng’ kwenung’wong’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’alalji Josua tisiik kolenji, Oganab moingetab arorutiet, ak oib olande ondoe bik. Koib anyun moingetab arorutiet, ak koba kondoe bik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Jehovah Josua, Atau rani atororin eng’ taitab Israel tugul, si kobiit konai kole, ko u ye kiami koboto Musa, ami koboten ko u noto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ing’at tisiik che ibei moingetab arorutiet, ilenji, Ye oit ngegutab beekab Jordan, otononse eng’ Jordan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo kolenji Josua lagokab Israel, Obwa yu, ogas ng’alekab Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole anyun Josua, Onae eng’ ni ole, mi kwenung’wong’ Kamuktaindet ne sobei, ak onei inendet Kanamik eng’ taing’wong’ matiny, ak Hitik, Hibik, Perisik, Girgasik, Amorik, ak Jebusik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeero, chorjingei Jordan moingetab arorutietab Kiptaiyat ne bo ng’ony komugul, kondoenak kolandoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noto anyun olewen bik taman ak aeng’ eng’ ortinwekab Israel, chito agenge eng’ oret age tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye tononie kelyekab tisiik che ibei moingetab Jehovah, Kiptaiatab ng’ony komugul, beekab Jordan, kopcheigei anyun beekab Jordan, ak kotononso beek che bunu meto kototen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingong’eetyo bik eng’ emaisiekwak, koba kolandae Jordan, kondoe tisiik che ibei moingetab arorutiet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ye kingoit Jordan che kiibei moingonoto, ak kingotiech che ibei moingonoto tabandab beek, (amu nyiiei beek ainetab Jordan kot kosiir ngegusiekyik tugul eng’ betusiek tugul che bo kesisiet,) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kotononso anyun beek che bunu meto koba barak, kototen eng’ ole loo, eng’ Adam, nganaset ne negite Saretan: ak beek che kichortagei koba araraitab Araba, noto ko Araraita ne bo Munyuk, ko kiigestagei: kolanda anyun bik kolong’ji ole tokyingei Jeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitononso tisiik che kiibei moingetab arorutietab Jehovah eng’ ole yaamat eng’ kwenutab Jordan, ak kilanda Israel tugul eng’ ole yaamat, kot kolanda bororiet tugul eng’ Jordan kogestagei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
